Z||000000||saleenfiero||07-04-2001||10:16 PM||||The guys at viperclub.org have a thread going on about painting your license plate to match your car.  Or more so painting everything but the letters and #'s.  Some of them seem to think its legal, supposedly its a big thing in europe and it may not break any laws here.  I don't know if I would do it, because its just another excuse to get pulled over, but I am curious.||||reg||1
